--TEST--
reading an enum case highlights the read itself and not the enum's declaration, because the use is resolved to the enum and recorded there while the declaration is not an occurrence at all, `rule:ide/five-features-are-one-reference-index`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Status: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Sta<|>tus::Draft;
--REQUEST--
documentHighlight
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:8:10
